---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Navbar } from '../components/Navbar';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { BOOKING_URL, LINKEDIN_URL } from '../consts';
---

<Layout title="Chi Sono - GinnyTech" description="Andrii Dyshkantiuk — analista dati e ingegnere. GinnyTech è un progetto educativo open-source per imparare Data Analytics e Marketing Engineering.">
  <div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col">
    <Navbar client:idle />

    <main id="main-content" class="relative flex-1 bg-[#050505] overflow-hidden selection:bg-neon-mint/30 selection:text-white">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[50vh] bg-gradient-to-b from-mint-900/10 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-[-10%] right-[-5%] w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-neon-blue/5 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 pt-32 pb-20 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6 font-heading">Chi Sono</h1>
        
        <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-sans text-lg">
          <p>
            Ciao, sono <strong class="text-white">Andrii Dyshkantiuk</strong>, analista dati e ingegnere con esperienza pratica nel marketing analytics, data engineering e business intelligence.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            <strong class="text-white">GinnyTech</strong> è un progetto educativo open-source che nasce dall'esigenza di condividere conoscenze reali — non teoria accademica, ma lezioni costruite dalla pratica quotidiana con dati, pipeline e dashboard.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            L'obiettivo è semplice: creare un percorso strutturato per chiunque voglia imparare l'analisi dati applicata al marketing, partendo da zero e arrivando a competenze avanzate in SQL, Python, ClickHouse e data science.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 my-10">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 font-heading">Il Progetto</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-300">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[#ccff00] mt-1">▸</span>
                <span><strong class="text-white">Open Source</strong> — tutto il contenuto è libero e accessibile a chiunque</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[#ccff00] mt-1">▸</span>
                <span><strong class="text-white">10 moduli, +70 lezioni</strong> — dal tracking dati alla data science avanzata</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-[#ccff00] mt-1">▸</span>
                <span><strong class="text-white">Pratica reale</strong> — ogni lezione nasce da esperienza sul campo</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <p>
            Se vuoi contattarmi, puoi trovarmi su LinkedIn o prenotare una call direttamente.
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-4">
            <a href={LINKEDIN_URL} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="px-6 py-3 bg-[#0077B5] hover:bg-[#006097] text-white font-semibold rounded-full transition-all hover:scale-105 font-ui flex items-center gap-2 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#0077B5] focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-[#050505]">
              LinkedIn
            </a>
            <a href={BOOKING_URL} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="px-6 py-3 bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-white font-semibold rounded-full border border-white/15 transition-all hover:border-[#ccff00]/50 font-ui focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#ccff00] focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-[#050505]">
              Prenota una Call
            </a>
          </div>

        <section class="mt-12 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3 font-heading">Vuoi iniziare subito il percorso?</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6">Se preferisci una guida pratica, puoi partire dal corso completo o prenotare una call di orientamento.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a href="/course" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#ccff00] text-black font-semibold hover:brightness-110 transition focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#ccff00] focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-[#050505]">Vai al Corso</a>
            <a href={BOOKING_URL} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-white hover:border-[#ccff00]/50 transition focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/70 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-[#050505]">Prenota una call</a>
          </div>
        </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </div>
</Layout>
